{"id":14770,"artist":"Jesse Colter. Seq","title":"I'm Not Lisa","lyrics_plain":"I'm not Lisa,\nMy name is Julie.\nLisa left you\nYears ago.\nMy eyes are not blue,\nBut mine won't leave you\nTill the sunlight\nHas touched your face.\nShe was your morning light,\nHer smile told of no night.\nYour love for her grew\nWith each rising sun.\nAnd then one winter day\nHis hand laid her away,\nShe left you here\nDrowning in your tears,\nHere, where you've stayed for years,\nCrying,\"Lisa, Lisa\".\nI'm not Lisa,\nMy name is Julie.\nLisa left you\nYears ago.\nMy eyes are not blue,\nBut mine won't leave you\nTill the sunlight\nShines through your face.\nI'm not Lisa.","lyrics_synced":"[00:03.94] I'm not Lisa,\n[00:08.86] My name is Julie.\n[00:14.35] Lisa left you\n[00:19.58] Years ago.\n[00:24.14] My eyes are not blue,\n[00:29.74] But mine won't leave you\n[00:35.22] Till the sunlight\n[00:40.14] Has touched your face.\n[00:46.68] She was your morning light,\n[00:51.90] Her smile told of no night.\n[00:57.13] Your love for her grew\n[01:00.72] With each rising sun.\n[01:07.61] And then one winter day\n[01:12.80] His hand laid her away,\n[01:17.34] She left you here\n[01:20.22] Drowning in your tears,\n[01:23.46] Here, where you've stayed for years,\n[01:28.39] Crying,\"Lisa, Lisa\".\n[01:37.86] I'm not Lisa,\n[01:42.76] My name is Julie.\n[01:48.29] Lisa left you\n[01:53.46] Years ago.\n[01:58.11] My eyes are not blue,\n[02:03.66] But mine won't leave you\n[02:09.11] Till the sunlight\n[02:13.72] Shines through your face.\n[02:19.59] I'm not Lisa.","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:03.94] <00:03.94>I'm <00:04.57>not <00:05.20>Li <00:06.48>sa,\n[00:08.85] <00:08.85>My <00:09.15>name <00:10.15>is <00:10.44>Ju <00:11.72>lie.\n[00:14.34] <00:14.34>Li <00:14.74>sa <00:15.65>left <00:16.93>you\n[00:19.57] <00:19.57>Years <00:20.59>a <00:20.90>go.\n[00:24.13] <00:24.13>My <00:24.78>eyes <00:25.41>are <00:25.83>n <00:26.11>ot <00:27.38>blue,\n[00:29.73] <00:29.73>But <00:30.04>mine <00:30